<title>USA: S&amp;K Famous January same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>S&amp;K Famous January same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		 $8.9	 $7.5     +19.0	+20.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $130.2     $122.8	+6.0	 +5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is four weeks ended January 25..</p>
<p>Full company name is S&amp;K Famous Brands Inc.</p>
<p>Note: The company said its fourth-quarter sales were $39.2 million, up from $38.5 million in the year-ago period. The company has not released earnings for the quarter.</p>
</text>
